{
  "_doc": "Tier-2 hardware & feed store on Route 9 (Pell's Crossing, lot 'hardware', front faces the highway). Route: front doors -> straight up the main aisle to the back-room doors (nailed shut from behind) -> along the back aisle to the office: can chimes strung across its doorway (jump them or wake the store) -> office -> back room (inventory note) -> loading bay: Calder at the foot of the ladder -> up through the hatch to the feed loft (loot: hatchet, nails, tools) -> lift the bar on the hoist doors -> drop through the rotten hoist platform into the side yard. Shopfront has a flat roof; the two-storey feed barn behind it a gable roof with the hoist hood. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
